---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { practice } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="cta-section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta reveal">
      <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cta-text">
        <h2 id="cta-title">Ξεκινάμε με ένα τηλεφώνημα <em>15 λεπτών.</em></h2>
        <p>Μου λέτε με λίγα λόγια τι σας απασχολεί, σας εξηγώ πώς δουλεύω και αποφασίζετε αν θέλετε να συνεχίσουμε.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-apricot" href="/#rantevou" data-pick="intro">Κλείστε ραντεβού <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
        <p class="phone"><Icon name="phone" />ή καλέστε στο <span class="nums">{practice.phone}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section { padding-block: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem) clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .cta {
    position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 0.6fr); gap: 2rem 3rem; align-items: end;
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--on-deep);
  }
  .glow { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; }
  .glow::before, .glow::after { content: ""; position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; }
  .glow::before {
    width: 40rem; height: 40rem; right: -14rem; bottom: -24rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--apricot) 40%, transparent) 0, transparent 65%);
    animation: cta-a 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .glow::after {
    width: 36rem; height: 36rem; left: -12rem; top: -20rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 70%, transparent) 0, transparent 65%);
    animation: cta-b 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes cta-a { to { translate: -10rem -4rem; } }
  @keyframes cta-b { to { translate: 8rem 6rem; } }

  .cta-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; min-width: 0; }
  h2 { color: var(--on-deep); max-width: 19ch; }
  h2 em { color: var(--apricot); }
  .cta-text p { color: var(--on-deep-soft); max-width: 36rem; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
  .phone { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--on-deep-soft); }
  .phone :global(svg) { width: 1rem; height: 1rem; color: var(--mint); }
  .phone span { color: var(--on-deep); font-weight: 700; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) { .cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
